Topic: On a phone with 8 GB of RAM and UFS flash, compare three ways a 35B-class Mixture-of-Experts model can run:

1. mmap the whole file and hope the kernel keeps hot pages,
2. stream only the routed experts each token into an LRU cache of about 2 GiB, with dense (non-expert) weights held in anonymous buffers,
3. split the dense trunk onto a mobile GPU and keep expert GEMMs on the CPU.

